{
  "_comment": "Ignition SCADA — Tag configuration for ICS Water Tank TK-001",
  "_instructions": [
    "1. In Ignition Designer: Tags → Import Tags → select this file",
    "2. Or use Ignition's Modbus TCP driver pointing to localhost:502 (via bridge.js) or the Replit server's Modbus TCP",
    "3. REST tags use the Ignition HTTP connector pointing to http://localhost:8080 (via bridge.js)"
